PRIMARY PRICE NEGATIVE
Advisory price can shape average activity,
but it does NOT guarantee a hard envelope under abrupt synchronized demand.

At the global shock onset,
price information has not yet propagated enough to prevent overshoot.

Thus:

PRICE CAN STEER RESOURCE DEMAND.

PRICE ALONE DOES NOT CONSERVE RESOURCE.

